K8s Architecture
-----------------

---> Cluster ---> Nodes ---> Pods ---> Containers ----> Application

Cluster --- MasterNode --- Worker nodes

MasterNode--->  API Server --- Heart of communication
                ETCD -- stores the data
                Scheduler -- it will check and decides which workernode
                Controller-Manager ---it will manage all 

WorkerNode----> Kubelet
                Kube-Proxy
                Container Runtime
                Pod

